# Spin down terminals after each run

When a task is complete (or you are about to stop), stop every process you started in this conversation — especially long-running ones such as `npm run dev`, Vite, and the API.

- Use the process PID from the terminal session (`taskkill /PID <pid> /T /F` on Windows).
- Do not leave background servers running after you finish.
- Do not kill terminals the user started themselves unless they asked you to stop them.
